## Summary

Together, this is the shape of it:
* A **mandate** fixes the frame before anything else happens.
* Five **Council seats** read the same material independently, so no single hallucination goes unchallenged.
* The **+1 Reporter** sifts consensus from noise rather than manufacturing certainty where none exists.
* The **Human Guardian**, not the math, makes the final call.

Take any one of those away and the system drifts. Keep all four, and it holds its shape.

ONE FALE holds the space for truth, nurtured and protected, while the human as Guardian and Guide tends to the space in between.

